What this licence does not cover

The MIT License above covers this project's own code and documentation. It does
not cover the following, which belong to their owners:

- Survey data. The survey files in data/ (survey_stats.js, survey_stats.json,
  survey_digest.txt and survey_insights.txt) are aggregated from "Social
  Acceptance of Sustainable Data Centres in Ireland", a Maynooth University
  survey supplied for the BU Induction Hack 2026. The survey and its results
  are not covered by this licence and belong to their owners.

- Facts and news claims. The facts, verdicts, policies and paraphrased news
  claims in data/facts.js come from the sources linked next to each item.
  That material belongs to those sources.

- Fonts. Unbounded, Figtree, DM Mono and Kalam are loaded from Google Fonts
  and are used under their own licences (SIL Open Font License).
